# Testing short positions: lots in liability accounts, opened by a sale
# (a negative posting) and closed by a purchase (a positive one).

# * Short positions

# ** 1. A negative lotful posting in a liability account opens a short lot (acquire); its basis and price must agree.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ {$100} @@ $1000
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print -x --verbose-tags
2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                       -10 XYZ {$100} @@ $1000  ; ptype: acquire
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000

>=

# ** 2. A short open whose basis and price disagree is an error, like any acquisition.
<
2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ {$100} @@ $900
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print
>2 /cost basis \(\$100\) differs from its transacted cost \(\$90\)/
>=1

# ** 3. A bare short open in a lotful commodity gets its basis from the price.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print -x
2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                       -10 XYZ {$100} @ $100
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000

>=

# ** 4. A total basis {{T}} on a short open gives a positive unit basis.
<
2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ {{$1000}}
    assets:broker:cash         $1000
$ hledger -f- print -x
2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                       -10 XYZ {$100} @ $100
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000

>=

# ** 5. A short open with a basis but no price gets the price inferred from the basis.
<
2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ {$100}
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print -x
2026-01-02 short sale
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                       -10 XYZ {$100} @ $100
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000

>=

# ** 6. A positive posting covers the short (dispose), FIFO by default, and the gain (basis minus cover cost) is generated.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-03 short 10 at 120
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $120
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover 15 at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    15 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print -x desc:cover
2026-02-02 cover 15 at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                        15 XYZ {} @ $90
    assets:broker:cash                        $-1350
    revenues:gain                              $-250

>=

# ** 7. Covering with LIFO.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots: LIFO

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-03 short 10 at 120
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $120
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover 15 at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    15 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- bal --lots -N
                $850  assets:broker:cash
              -5 XYZ  liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}
               $-350  revenues:gain

# ** 8. Covering with HIFO takes the highest short-sale price first (realising the largest gain first).
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots: HIFO

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-03 short 10 at 120
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $120
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover 15 at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    15 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- bal --lots -N
                $850  assets:broker:cash
              -5 XYZ  liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}
               $-350  revenues:gain

# ** 9. Covering part of a specific lot with SPECID.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots: SPECID

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-03 short 10 at 120
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $120
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover 5 of the 120 lot at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    5 XYZ {$120} @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- bal --lots -N
               $1750  assets:broker:cash
             -10 XYZ  liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}
              -5 XYZ  liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-03, $120}
               $-150  revenues:gain

# ** 10. A user-written gain posting is checked.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash       $-900
    revenues:gain            $-100
$ hledger -f- print -x desc:cover
2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                        10 XYZ {2026-01-02, $100} @ $90
    assets:broker:cash                         $-900
    revenues:gain                              $-100

>=

# ** 11. A wrong user-written gain is an error.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash       $-900
    revenues:gain            $-50
$ hledger -f- print
>2 /realised gain amount is wrong/
>=1

# ** 12. An amountless gain posting is filled in.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- print -x desc:cover
2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                        10 XYZ {2026-01-02, $100} @ $90
    assets:broker:cash                         $-900
    revenues:gain                              $-100

>=

# ** 13. A cover with a basis but no price gets the price inferred from the cash posting.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover, price not written
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ {$100}
    assets:broker:cash       $-900
$ hledger -f- print -x desc:cover
2026-02-02 cover, price not written
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                        10 XYZ {2026-01-02, $100} @@ $900
    assets:broker:cash                         $-900
    revenues:gain                              $-100

>=

# ** 14. Covering more than the short position is an error.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover 15 at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    15 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print
>2 /Insufficient lots for commodity XYZ in account liabilities:broker:XYZ: need 15 but only 10 available/
>=1

# ** 15. A short sale in an asset account is still an error, with a hint.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short sale, in an asset account
    assets:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print
>2 /\(To record a short position, use a liability account.\)/
>=1

# ** 16. At cost, a short position offsets the cash received.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

P 2026-01-31 XYZ $90

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- bs -B -e 2026-02
Balance Sheet 2026-01-31, converted to cost

                        || 2026-01-31 
========================++============
 Assets                 ||            
------------------------++------------
 assets:broker:cash     ||      $1000 
------------------------++------------
                        ||      $1000 
========================++============
 Liabilities            ||            
------------------------++------------
 liabilities:broker:XYZ ||      $1000 
------------------------++------------
                        ||      $1000 
========================++============
 Net:                   ||          0 

# ** 17. At market value, the difference is the unrealised gain.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

P 2026-01-31 XYZ $90

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- bs -V -e 2026-02
Balance Sheet 2026-01-31, valued at period ends

                        || 2026-01-31 
========================++============
 Assets                 ||            
------------------------++------------
 assets:broker:cash     ||      $1000 
------------------------++------------
                        ||      $1000 
========================++============
 Liabilities            ||            
------------------------++------------
 liabilities:broker:XYZ ||       $900 
------------------------++------------
                        ||       $900 
========================++============
 Net:                   ||       $100 

# ** 18. bal --gain shows a short's unrealised gain (positive when the price has fallen).
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

P 2026-01-31 XYZ $90

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- bal --gain -e 2026-02
                $100  liabilities:broker:XYZ
--------------------
                $100  

# ** 19. After covering, the realised gain is revenue and the liability is gone.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

P 2026-01-31 XYZ $90

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- bse
Balance Sheet With Equity 2026-02-02

                    || 2026-02-02 
====================++============
 Assets             ||            
--------------------++------------
 assets:broker:cash ||       $100 
--------------------++------------
                    ||       $100 
====================++============
 Liabilities        ||            
--------------------++------------
--------------------++------------
                    ||          0 
====================++============
 Equity             ||            
--------------------++------------
--------------------++------------
                    ||          0 
====================++============
 Net:               ||       $100 

# ** 20. holdings shows a short position with negative units and cost, a positive gain, and no XIRR (not meaningful for a short).
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

P 2026-01-31 XYZ $90

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- holdings -e 2026-02
Holdings on 2026-01-31

                        ||       Date  Age    Units  Avg cost  Price    Cost  Value  Weight  UGain  UGain%  RGain  XIRR 
========================++==============================================================================================
 liabilities:broker:XYZ || 2026-01-02  29d  -10 XYZ      $100    $90  $-1000  $-900  100.0%   $100   10.0%              
------------------------++----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                        ||                  -10 XYZ      $100         $-1000  $-900  100.0%   $100   10.0%              

# ** 21. holdings shows a covered short's realised gain.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

P 2026-01-31 XYZ $90

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- holdings -E
Holdings on 2026-09-30

                        || Date  Age  Units  Avg cost  Price  Cost  Value  Weight  UGain  UGain%  RGain  XIRR 
========================++====================================================================================
 liabilities:broker:XYZ ||            0 XYZ              $90           $0                          $100       
------------------------++------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                        ||                                       0                                 $100       

# ** 22. print -x --lots output of short entries can be re-read.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- print -x --lots | hledger -f- print -x --lots
2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}    -10 XYZ {2026-01-02, $100} @ $100
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}     10 XYZ {2026-01-02, $100} @ $90
    assets:broker:cash                         $-900
    revenues:gain                              $-100

>=

# ** 23. --infer-equity adds conversion postings for short entries, which balance.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- print -x --infer-equity | hledger -f- bal -N
                $100  assets:broker:cash
               $-100  revenues:gain

# ** 24. lots: NONE on a liability account disables short lot tracking.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:
account liabilities:broker:XYZ  ; lots: NONE

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
$ hledger -f- print -x --verbose-tags
2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                       -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                        10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash                         $-900

>=

# ** 25. Transferring a short position between liability accounts is not supported yet.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker1:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 move the short position to another broker
    liabilities:broker1:XYZ    10 XYZ
    liabilities:broker2:XYZ   -10 XYZ
$ hledger -f- print
>2 /Liability accounts hold short positions, and transferring those between/
>=1

# ** 26. close --clopen --lots moves short lots to and from equity, preserving them.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-31 closing balances  ; clopen:24
    assets:broker:cash                         $-1000     = $0
    liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}      10 XYZ
    equity:opening/closing balances

2026-02-01 opening balances  ; clopen:24
    assets:broker:cash                         $1000     = $1000
    liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-02, $100}    -10 XYZ
    equity:opening/closing balances

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- print -x desc:cover
2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ                        10 XYZ {2026-01-02, "0001", $100} @ $90
    assets:broker:cash                         $-900
    revenues:gain                              $-100

>=

# ** 27. Long lots (in asset accounts) and short lots (in liability accounts) of a commodity are separate pools, which may use different methods even when one is global.
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots: FIFOALL
account liabilities:broker:XYZ  ; lots: LIFO

2026-01-02 buy 10 at 100
    assets:broker:XYZ         10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-03 short 10 at 110
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $110
    assets:broker:cash

2026-01-04 short 10 at 120
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $120
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover 10 at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain

2026-02-03 sell 10 at 90
    assets:broker:XYZ        -10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash
    revenues:gain
$ hledger -f- bal -N --lots
               $1300  assets:broker:cash
             -10 XYZ  liabilities:broker:XYZ:{2026-01-03, $110}
               $-200  revenues:gain

# ** 28. --ignore-lots loads short entries without lot tracking (a written gain is not checked).
<
commodity XYZ  ; lots:

2026-01-02 short 10 at 100
    liabilities:broker:XYZ   -10 XYZ @ $100
    assets:broker:cash

2026-02-02 cover at 90
    liabilities:broker:XYZ    10 XYZ @ $90
    assets:broker:cash       $-900
    revenues:gain            $-50
$ hledger -f- bal -I -N
                $100  assets:broker:cash
                $-50  revenues:gain
